    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>Developed by Kassa Fabrication for Shadow Broker operatives, the M-12 Locust bridges the gap between submachine gun and assault rifle. Heavier than standard SMGs but still manageable one-handed, it fires a larger round than its competitors with enough precision to engage targets at significantly greater range. Intelligence operatives who expect contact in confined environments but cannot afford to be caught with a full-sized rifle favor the Locust as their primary weapon.</p>"
